  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Hairpin</em></p>\n<p>When you use Hairpin, you can spend an additional 1 cursed energy per nail. If the creature fails its saves, it becomes Restrained by needles of cursed energy. An affected creature can make a Strength (Athletics) or Dexterity (Acrobatics) check against your cursed energy save at the end of their turn, freeing themselves on a success. On a failure, they take 1d8 piercing damage.</p>",
